#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""End-to-end tests for the UUID -> job-folder routing of the share server.

The server rule is intentionally simple and strict:

  * a UUID that already exists for the same user + experiment updates that
    exact run folder in place;
  * any UUID that does not exist there (including a UUID that belongs to a
    different user / experiment) creates a brand-new run folder;
  * a missing/empty UUID always creates a brand-new run folder -- it must
    NEVER be merged into the newest existing share.

These tests upload real manifest + bundle requests to a PHP built-in server
running the actual ``.gui/share_internal.php`` and inspect the resulting
share tree.  They also run the PHP unit tests for the routing helpers.
"""

